          "text": "Dysphagia with episodic chest discomfort; possible eosinophilic oesophagitis versus GORD versus motility or structural cause"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Condition/condition-2",
      "resource": {
